  "details": "EDIT: Updated title to reflect that user reporting is affected as well.\n\nTested on Open Beta but also working under the assumption this occurs on Live as well.\nI am no longer able to report worlds for any reasons whatsoever anymore instead it just tells me I've already submitted a report, even if I had never visited and reported the world before.\nIn the video linked below, only the first world I reported, I had actually reported prior due to no collider under spawn, but the other worlds shown I had not reported.\n\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/d4ftz3.mp4",
